1
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,640
Mobei is vast and sparsely populated.

2
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,760
If we lead light cavalry to pursue the enemy,

3
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,560
how should we deploy our troops?

4
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,160
General Cheng,

5
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,680
in my opinion,

6
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,160
the troops

7
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,000
can be divided into three units.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,080
Nomadic tribes are adept at judging the enemy's situation by smoke and dust.

9
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:29,640
Therefore,

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,800
the vanguard needs only a hundred cavalry,

11
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,080
slowly raising dust

12
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,640
to pretend to be the main force,

13
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,240
and then expose themselves.

14
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:38,960
The middle unit

15
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,680
will pretend to be wounded soldiers,

16
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,680
abandoning their armor and scattering supplies,

17
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,400
acting sluggish.

18
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:47,040
The enemy will surely think our army is in chaos,

19
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:47,720
and thus

20
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,840
underestimate us.

21
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,240
If the enemy divides their forces to guard the water,

22
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,240
what will you do?

23
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,289
A formidable youth indeed.

24
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:29,840
Father.

25
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:32,420
Satisfying General Cheng and the others

26
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,560
is no easy task.

27
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,259
Do not slack in your study of military strategy.

28
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,600
I will strictly follow your teachings, Father.

29
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,759
If there's nothing else,

30
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,160
you may leave.

31
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,880
I have one more request.

32
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,960
I beg you to show mercy,

33
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,810
and spare Lady Fang.

34
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,640
Regarding the matter at the post station that day,

35
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,039
there must be a misunderstanding.

36
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:56,560
Moreover, Lady Fang has been in prison

37
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,000
and punished for many days.

38
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,800
Now that

39
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:00,640
the little prince of Quantan has returned,

40
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,170
please show mercy, Father.

41
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,280
I heard

42
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,080
in your previous mansion,

43
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,860
flowers were not allowed.

44
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,560
Yes.

45
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,680
It's a good habit.

46
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,370
Seeing too many flowers

47
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:25,840
indeed distracts the mind.

48
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,740
Then let's do this.

49
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:31,120
General Cheng's daughter

50
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,050
is of marriageable age.

51
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,940
Since that's the case,

52
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,880
divorce that merchant's daughter

53
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,160
as well.

54
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:43,200
Your horoscopes have been matched.

55
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:46,000
Ten days from now is an auspicious day.

56
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,720
I will

57
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,100
send the betrothal gifts for you.

58
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,200
Thank you, Father.

59
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:39,480
Recalling when we first met,

60
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:42,540
I took you into my mansion.

61
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,240
I hoped we would respect each other

62
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,520
and live in harmony.

63
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,400
But things went contrary to my wishes.

64
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,840
As a family member of the Commander's mansion,

65
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,800
you did not speak and act cautiously,

66
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,280
contradicted your parents,

67
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,740
and disobeyed etiquette.

68
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:00,480
Today, I write this letter of divorce.

69
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,440
From now on,

70
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,000
our ties are completely severed.

71
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,400
I hope that in the future,

72
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,640
you will speak and act cautiously,

73
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,000
abide by the law,

74
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,840
and make no more mistakes.

75
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,440
Written by

76
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,360
Chu Shengyi.

77
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,120
I, Fang Zhuozhuo,

78
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,610
thank you, Third Young Master.

79
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,200
You may go.

80
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,680
Now that your leg condition

81
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,010
can no longer be hidden,

82
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:20,440
how do you think the commander will treat you?

83
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:22,720
My eldest brother passed away the year before last.

84
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,720
My second brother

85
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:27,180
died in Kuishui along with the Marquis of Douyu.

86
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,280
The position of the heir

87
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,210
has always been my father's worry.

88
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,620
Otherwise, his health wouldn't have

89
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,200
deteriorated so much after he learned

90
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,760
of my eldest brother's death.

91
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,360
I am now his only son.

92
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,250
If he knows my leg has fully recovered,

93
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:44,480
he will definitely change his attitude towards me.

94
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,740
The more he values you,

95
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,680
the greater my chances of survival.

96
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,340
You know it well in your heart.

97
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,120
This matter can't be blamed on you,

98
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,880
nor on Madam Li.

99
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,480
The commander

100
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,159
would never offend Quantan

101
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,160
for my sake.

102
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:02,120
In the end,

103
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,680
this crime

104
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,280
will only fall on me.

105
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,520
If he punishes you,

106
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,120
you must not

107
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,960
resist.

108
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,920
Find a suitable opportunity

109
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,840
to propose a divorce.

110
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,520
Indeed.

111
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,680
For my father,

112
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,520
this is a good deal.

113
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,040
Chu Shengyi,

114
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,480
from this moment on,

115
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,240
we are even.

116
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:57,840
Did the master really take Chu Shengyi to the racecourse?

117
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,840
Absolutely.

118
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,360
I heard he even went to the Cheng Residence on purpose,

119
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:05,480
taking General Cheng and his daughter with him.

120
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,400
It seems

121
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:09,530
the marriage alliance with the Cheng family is settled.

122
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:13,600
General Cheng has high prestige in the army.

123
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:16,640
If Chu Shengyi really joins hands with the Cheng family,

124
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,440
I'm afraid...

125
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,000
Madam.

126
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:37,840
This flower

127
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,760
is so beautiful.

128
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,380
Madam, forgive me.

129
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,020
I wouldn't dare again.

130
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,360
I will never dare again.

131
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,120
Don't move.

132
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,560
Don't move.

133
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,260
Madam, forgive me.

134
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,580
I wouldn't dare again.

135
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,480
I will never dare again.

136
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,520
Don't move.

137
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,360
The flower is beautiful,

138
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,960
but you don't deserve it.

139
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,930
You're just a skinny slave no matter how much you eat.

140
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,320
We still

141
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,080
have a bargaining chip in our hands.

142
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,560
Fang Zhuozhuo.

143
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,800
But

144
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,080
the Third Master

145
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,080
has already divorced her.

146
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:37,400
It's exactly because he would rather divorce her to save her,

147
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:40,059
which proves how important this woman is to him.

148
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,240
We need to let him know

149
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:45,480
that even if Fang Zhuozhuo is released,

150
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,840
she still can't escape my grasp.

151
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,040
Should we capture her first?

152
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,240
Since the master promised to release her,

153
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,840
there must be a deeper meaning.

154
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,640
If we conflict recklessly now,

155
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:59,640
we will surely lose the master's favor.

156
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:00,280
Then

157
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:02,280
what does madam mean?

158
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,160
Zuirong Sect.

159
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:10,420
isn't she the most suitable one to discipline the Shou slaves?

160
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:14,440
Since the master has handed this rule over to me,

161
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,600
I have the right to tighten it up for her.

162
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,400
That's a brilliant move, Madam.

163
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,200
If Chu Shengyi

164
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,930
dares to come back and protect Fang Zhuozhuo,

165
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:28,720
it will definitely jeopardize his marriage contract with the Cheng family

166
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,450
and disappoint the Commander.

167
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,880
Although the master has no biological son,

168
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:35,140
there are many collateral descendants.

169
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,800
The position of the heir

170
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,440
does not necessarily have to be Chu Shengyi's.

171
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,360
Notice to all workshops,

172
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,020
guilds, and merchant houses:

173
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:48,880
From today onwards, any female with Shou status belonging to Zuirongjiao

174
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:50,840
shall not be employed or taken in.

175
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,840
Violators

176
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:54,440
will be punished for violating the religious decree,

177
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,600
fined 100 taels of silver,

178
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,260
and put in a cangue for 15 days.

179
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,400
How can I live?

180
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,640
I'm begging you!

181
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,450
Baizhe Shou Rice

182
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,560
Go away.

183
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,890
I'm not leaving.

184
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,640
Go away. Go!

185
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,440
Granny Lan has been settled in the black market.

186
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,800
There are 30 taels of silver in the interlayer of the parcel.

187
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,600
We chipped in.

188
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,080
Things are tense recently.

189
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,740
You should hide for a few days.

190
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,760
Get lost.

191
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,000
You jinx.

192
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,410
Don't get our Yanzhi Pavilion in trouble.

193
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:20,320
Go away. Go!

194
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:21,400
Go away. Go!

195
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,880
Granny,

196
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,200
you're awake.

197
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:48,840
Miss,

198
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,320
are you okay?

199
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,200
I'm fine.

200
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,010
Thanks to Granny for saving me.

201
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,330
It's good that you're fine.

202
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:01,570
It's good that you're fine.

203
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,560
Are we

204
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,090
back in the black market again?

205
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,300
Some things happened in between.

206
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,760
You should rest and recover first.

207
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:14,160
I'll tell you in detail when you're better.

208
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,300
It's still not bright enough.

209
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,200
This mica...

210
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:32,120
It's not muscovite, is it?

211
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,760
You saw it too, Granny.

212
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:40,040
The final round of the Makeup Ceremony is at night.

213
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:42,760
It's highly likely to be a dark makeup competition.

214
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:45,020
I want to mix some powder for use at night.

215
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,360
But this mica...

216
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,040
It's just not ideal.

217
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,880
Is it not available

218
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,730
in the black market either?

219
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,480
Muscovite of that quality

220
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,000
is not an ordinary item.

221
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,140
I've asked around.

222
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:59,480
The black market is out of stock.

223
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:01,960
As for the shops outside,

224
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:05,220
they've been strictly driving away thin girls these days.

225
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,020
In a couple of days,

226
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:09,440
I'll go back to Yanzhi Pavilion to get some.

227
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,520
You rest first, Granny.

228
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,850
I'll go prepare dinner.

229
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,280
The final round

230
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,120
is in a few days.

231
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,400
What is the young lady going to do alone?

232
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,200
Granny?

233
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,760
Granny!

234
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:13,740
What's the matter?

235
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,080
Even you, Momo,

236
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:18,880
can't stand this thin face of mine?

237
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,840
I wouldn't dare.

238
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,130
The subordinates reported

239
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,880
that they saw Granny Lan,

240
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:27,840
who is with Fang Zhuozhuo, on the street.

241
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:37,400
I've been fishing for a long time without seeing any fish.

242
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:38,640
Now the fish

243
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,840
has jumped out on its own.

244
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,520
Fang Zhuozhuo,

245
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,960
she will definitely appear tonight.

246
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,640
As usual,

247
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:51,760
tell this news

248
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,640
to the Third Young Master.

249
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,000
He'll judge for himself.

250
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,080
Yes.

251
00:14:58,760 --> 00:14:59,920
Also,

252
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,560
tell the subordinates

253
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,320
to draw in the net cleverly.

254
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:10,240
We have to leave some time

255
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,200
for our devoted Third Young Master

256
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:16,480
to play out this scene of a hero saving the beauty.

257
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,440
Don't we?

258
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,000
I understand.

259
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:27,730
The poison from the Qionghua rouge is getting worse.

260
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,040
The powder can barely cover it up.

261
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,400
To rectify social customs,

262
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:40,720
starting from today,

263
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:43,560
a curfew is imposed on the entire city of Kuizhou.

264
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:46,040
From 7:45 PM to 4:00 AM,

265
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,720
any thin and weak woman who sneaks out

266
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:52,370
will be beaten to death immediately, regardless of the reason.

267
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,170
They are over there.

268
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:08,680
Why are there so many soldiers all of a sudden?

269
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:09,320
Could it be

270
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,960
because of the Zuirong Cult?

271
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:29,440
How dare you run? Keep running.

272
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,280
Run.

273
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,440
Granny.

274
00:16:34,880 --> 00:16:35,520
It's me.

275
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,600
The orders from above are

276
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:45,480
to lure that thin slave out.

277
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,020
Just do as you are told.

278
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:49,160
Granny is seriously injured.

279
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,360
I'm afraid she can't be saved.

280
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,240
Old thing,

281
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,560
scream a little louder.

282
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:54,440
Maybe your master will hear you

283
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,960
and rush over to save you.

284
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,680
If you go out now,

285
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:01,480
you'll fall right into Madam Li's trap.

286
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,240
Old thing.
